Hello dear unmarked users,
I want to use the single season occupancy modeling for ten most detected species. The problem I am facing now is the camera stations were only 700m apart and are not representatively laid across the study area. Thus, I assume there will be spatial autocorrelation amongst the camera sites.
Could anyone kindly suggest me how to check the spatial autocorrelation amongst the  camera sites (I have 53 camera sites).
Thank you so much for your any valuable comments or suggestions.
Best regards,
Aye

